sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(MCP Client)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS Edge
    participant Server as RHOAI MCP Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDC Auth Middleware
    participant IDP as OIDC Issuer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RBAC as RBAC Checker
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Plugin as Domain Plugin
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Agent,K8sAPI: Flow 1: MCP Tool Call (OIDC Enabled)
        Agent->>Route: POST /messages (or GET /sse)<br/>Bearer Token (OIDC JWT/OCP OAuth)
        Route->>Server: Forward (TLS terminated at edge)

        Server->>OIDC: Validate Bearer Token
        alt JWT Mode
            OIDC->>IDP: GET /.well-known/openid-configuration<br/>GET /jwks (HTTPS/TLS 1.2+)
            IDP-->>OIDC: JWKS keys
            OIDC->>OIDC: Validate JWT signature & claims
        else TokenReview Mode
            OIDC->>K8sAPI: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>SA Token (TLS 1.2+)
            K8sAPI-->>OIDC: TokenReview result (username, groups)
            OIDC->>K8sAPI: GET /apis/user.openshift.io/v1/users/~<br/>Fetch group memberships
            K8sAPI-->>OIDC: User groups
        end
        OIDC-->>Server: Authenticated identity (username, groups)

        Server->>RBAC: Filter tools for user
        RBAC->>K8sAPI: POST SubjectAccessReview<br/>(per tool, deduplicated)<br/>SA Token + Impersonate-User/Group
        K8sAPI-->>RBAC: allowed/denied per resource
        RBAC-->>Server: Filtered tool list

        Server->>Plugin: Execute requested tool
        Plugin->>K8sAPI: K8s API call<br/>SA Token + Impersonate-User/Group headers<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: Resource response
        Plugin-->>Server: Tool result

        Server-->>Route: SSE/HTTP response
        Route-->>Agent: JSON result
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Server,ModelReg: Flow 2: Model Registry Discovery and Query
        Server->>Plugin: model_registry tool call

        Plugin->>K8sAPI: GET ModelRegistry CRD<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: ModelRegistry resource

        Plugin->>K8sAPI: GET Services in model-registry namespace<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
        K8sAPI-->>Plugin: Service endpoints

        alt Outside Cluster
            Plugin->>K8sAPI: Port-forward to Model Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
            K8sAPI-->>Plugin: Tunnel established (localhost:random)
        end

        Plugin->>ModelReg: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (or localhost:random)
        ModelReg-->>Plugin: Model metadata JSON

        Plugin-->>Server: Formatted model data
    end
